// staqex-lane: experiment
// B18 — finiteize surface (ADR 0185 Lane A / LISS-0313).
// Continuous draws stay Host-side; notebook spells explicit finiteization.
// No mid-program Continuous type — result is ordinary finite State.

// Uniform continuous samples on [0, 1) → equal-width histogram (2 bins).
// finiteize(lo, hi, n_bins, n_samples[, seed])
State psi = finiteize(0.0, 1.0, 2, 2000, 0)
Measure psi
